# Copy to Vercel → Settings → Environment Variables (Production + Preview as needed)
# Never commit real tokens to git.

# Required: dispatch workflow + poll status (list runs/jobs needs Actions read)
# Fine-grained PAT: repo marketUSDA → Contents: Read, Actions: Read and write
# Or classic PAT: scope `workflow`
GITHUB_TOKEN=

# Required for Turkey MARS API refreshes and Turkey data builders.
# USDA_MARS_API_KEY=

# Required by the weekly GitHub Actions job to update Whole Turkey rows.
# Keep the service-role key only in GitHub Actions secrets, never in client-side environment variables.
# SUPABASE_URL=
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY=

# Optional (defaults: tridinhbui / marketUSDA)
# GITHUB_OWNER=
# GITHUB_REPO=
